# Xyne Desk reply
> Replies sent from the Desk ticket UI go out through the channel mailbox (fake Gmail outbox).

## Reply goes to the customer on the original thread
* Setting up Desk channel "channel-desk-reply" for user "admin-1"
* Receiving Desk email ticket "ticket-desk-reply" with cc in channel "channel-desk-reply" for user "admin-1"
* Opening Desk ticket "ticket-desk-reply" in channel "channel-desk-reply" for user "admin-1"
* replying with "Reply" to open Desk ticket "ticket-desk-reply" for user "admin-1"
* verifying fake Gmail sent "Reply" for Desk ticket "ticket-desk-reply" for user "admin-1"

## Reply all keeps the customer's cc recipients
* Setting up Desk channel "channel-desk-reply-all" for user "admin-1"
* Receiving Desk email ticket "ticket-desk-reply-all" with cc in channel "channel-desk-reply-all" for user "admin-1"
* Opening Desk ticket "ticket-desk-reply-all" in channel "channel-desk-reply-all" for user "admin-1"
* replying with "Reply all" to open Desk ticket "ticket-desk-reply-all" for user "admin-1"
* verifying fake Gmail sent "Reply all" for Desk ticket "ticket-desk-reply-all" for user "admin-1"
